 "remarks": "Welcome to 5 Norman Lane, a refined two-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom townhouse situated within the sought-after Villager Pond community. Positioned at the rear of the complex for maximum privacy, this residence offers a seamless connection to the adjacent parklands. The main level is anchored by a gracious living room featuring classic hardwood floors and elegant French doors that open to a private brick patio and yard-perfect for indoor-outdoor entertaining. The kitchen and dining areas are thoughtfully proportioned, offering a functional flow for both daily living and hosting guests. Exceptional amenities include an attached one-car garage, an additional dedicated parking space, and ample visitor parking. Residents also enjoy access to the pristine community swimming pool and pool house. Located just moments from downtown Darien, this home provides effortless access to premier local boutiques, dining, and the Metro-North station.",
